stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> AUTHORIZED: POST /orders 201<br/>(all lines reserved + authorize 200,<br/>persisted in one transaction)

    note left of AUTHORIZED
        Checkout failures never create an order:
        400 invalid / unknown payment method
        402 declined · 409 out of stock · 503 payment down
        (reserved lines released on every failure)
        PENDING, RESERVED, RESERVATION_FAILED removed
    end note

    AUTHORIZED --> DISPATCHING: PaymentAuthorized
    DISPATCHING --> DISPATCHED: DispatchConfirmed
    DISPATCHING --> DISPATCH_FAILED: DispatchFailed
    DISPATCHING --> AUTH_EXPIRED: PaymentAuthorizationExpired

    DISPATCHED --> CONFIRMED: PaymentCaptured
    DISPATCHED --> PAYMENT_FAILED: capture failed<br/>(manual reconciliation)

    AUTH_EXPIRED --> CANCELLED: release stock, notify
    DISPATCH_FAILED --> CANCELLED: void authorization,<br/>release stock, notify

    PAYMENT_FAILED --> [*]
    CONFIRMED --> [*]
    CANCELLED --> [*]
